# SYNTHETIC. Written from RFC 5804 (ManageSieve), with capability lines in the shape a
# Pigeonhole server sends them. Not a recording.
# STARTTLS is required and the server does not offer it. No credential may be
# written: the session ends at the capabilities.
S: "IMPLEMENTATION" "Example Sieve"
S: "SASL" "PLAIN LOGIN"
S: "SIEVE" "fileinto vacation"
S: "VERSION" "1.0"
S: OK "ready"
FAIL Unsupported
